      <h1 style="margin-top:10px">Badminton club rating systems: what the number knows</h1>
      <p class="lede">A rating is not a verdict on how good you are. It is an estimate built from the opponents you faced, the results that came back and the assumptions inside the model.</p>
      <div class="guide-meta">
        <span class="gm-tag">Explainer</span>
        <span>Ratings</span>
        <span>11 min read</span>
